abstract: >-
  Quarto analysis book for the International RSE Survey
  2026, with a focus on Nordic respondents. It includes a
  Nordic insights summary of career paths, skills, tools,
  generative AI use, community priorities, and related
  topics, plus question-by-question chapters with tables and
  figures. The book was produced by Nordic-RSE using Quarto
  and R. 
